Package: codex-switcher
Version: 3.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: curl, python3
Maintainer: luoxihao <luoxihao2001@outlook.com>
Description: Codex provider/relay switcher with /models auto-sync
 Switch between OpenAI-compatible relay profiles for Codex CLI. Add an API
 (base_url + key), auto-discover the relay's /models into the profile model
 catalog, and let /model switch between all supported models.
